WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.700
A tag can go inside another tag, and the last one opened closes first

2
00:00:05.851 --> 00:00:09.801
&lt;strong&gt; marks important words. It goes inside the paragraph.

3
00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:14.152
Another tag can go inside it. &lt;em&gt; stresses a word.

4
00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:22.841
Close the last tag you opened first: &lt;/em&gt;, then &lt;/strong&gt;, then &lt;/p&gt;.
